From bbdcc32653ecd595c55ed0cbb79ce559d28e1234 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: d012 setup <setup@localhost>
Date: Sun, 22 Nov 2026 15:23:23 +0100
Subject: [PATCH] Dissidia 012 port changes to PortableKit

Every change this port makes to PortableKit on top of the upstream port's series (third_party/dissidia012-pc/port/portablekit-patches), as one patch:
the online relay and rooms, the fixed settings, Game speed, the boot skip's fast time, Android and iOS support, texture packs and more.
